        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Yeager Airport, Albert J. Ellis Airport, Charleston, Kanawha County, West Virginia, Onslow County, North Carolina, United States\n- Events: Southwest Airlines Flight 2294 emergency landing\n- Organizations: Southwest Airlines\n- Concepts: airport codes, public airports, county-owned public-use airports\n\nFacts:\n- Yeager Airport has IATA code CRW, ICAO code KCRW, and FAA LID CRW.\n- Yeager Airport is a public airport three miles east of downtown Charleston in Kanawha County, West Virginia, United States.\n- Albert J. Ellis Airport has IATA code OAJ, ICAO code KOAJ, and FAA LID OAJ.\n- Albert J. Ellis Airport is a county-owned public-use airport in Onslow County, North Carolina, United States.\n- On July 13, 2009, Southwest Airlines Flight 2294 made an emergency landing at Yeager Airport in Charleston, West Virginia.\n- Southwest Airlines Flight 2294 was a scheduled US passenger flight that made the emergency landing after a rapid depressurization of the passenger cabin.",
